        "abstract": "Radio Frequency Interference contamination for Earth Observation satellites is an on-growing problem, but the situation is not properly reported. A new IEEE standard is being developed to quantify the amount of RFI in the frequency bands used by remote sensing satellites. This standard will allow for a proper monitoring of the RFI trends in each frequency band",
